---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Shorter: Haircuts, On Demand"
  description="Shorter is an on-demand booking app for barbers and customers. Join the waitlist, customer or barber, for early access and founder updates."
>
  <Nav />

  <section class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Coming to Melbourne, early 2027</span>
        <h1>Need a haircut right now? Shorter finds you a barber, on demand.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Shorter is the fastest way to find a quality barber near you and book them on
          the spot: no walk-ins, no five different Instagram DMs, no wasted time on
          booking websites only displaying slots for another time, no guessing who's free.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href="#customer-waitlist" class="btn btn-primary">Join as a customer</a>
          <a href="#barber-waitlist" class="btn btn-outline">Join as a Founding Barber</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="phone phone-back">
          <img src="/images/app-barber-dashboard.png" alt="Shorter barber dashboard screen" width="404" height="1295" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="phone phone-front">
          <img src="/images/app-customer-home.png" alt="Shorter customer home screen" width="404" height="863" fetchpriority="high" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="stats">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stat">
        <b>6 mo.</b>
        <span>Build in progress with our development partner</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <b>Melbourne</b>
        <span>Where Shorter launches first</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <b>Early 2027</b>
        <span>Target launch, pending App Store &amp; Google Play review</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="waitlist-block" id="customer-waitlist">
    <div class="wrap waitlist-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow on-light">For customers</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:16px;">Skip the walk-in. Book a barber in minutes.</h2>
        <p style="max-width:440px;">
          Be first to know when Shorter goes live near you, plus a few things to make
          your first booking better than your last haircut.
        </p>
        <ul class="benefit-list">
          <li><span class="tick">✓</span> Early access before public launch</li>
          <li><span class="tick">✓</span> A discounted first booking for waitlist members</li>
          <li><span class="tick">✓</span> First pick of top-rated Founding Barbers near you</li>
          <li><span class="tick">✓</span> Say goodbye to unanswered DMs and guessing who's free</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="waitlist-form">
        <h3>Join the customer waitlist</h3>
        <p class="form-sub">Takes about 30 seconds. No spam, just launch news.</p>

        <form class="js-waitlist-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/xqernrla" method="POST">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New Shorter customer waitlist signup" />
          <input type="hidden" name="audience" value="customer" />

          <div class="field">
            <label for="c-name">Full name</label>
            <input id="c-name" type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name" />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="c-contact">Email or mobile number</label>
            <input id="c-contact" type="text" name="contact" required autocomplete="email" />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="c-suburb">Suburb</label>
            <input id="c-suburb" type="text" name="suburb" placeholder="e.g. Dandenong, VIC" required />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="c-frequency">How often do you get a haircut?</label>
            <select id="c-frequency" name="haircut_frequency">
              <option value="every-2-weeks">Every 2 weeks</option>
              <option value="monthly" selected>Monthly</option>
              <option value="every-6-8-weeks">Every 6–8 weeks</option>
              <option value="occasionally">Occasionally / when needed</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label>Preferred booking type</label>
            <div class="radio-row">
              <label><input type="radio" name="booking_type" value="mobile" checked /> Mobile barber</label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="booking_type" value="in-shop" /> In-shop</label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="booking_type" value="either" /> Either</label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Join the waitlist</button>
          <p class="form-foot">By joining, you agree to be contacted about Shorter's launch. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
          <div class="form-status" role="status"></div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="waitlist-block dark" id="barber-waitlist">
    <div class="wrap waitlist-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Founding Barber Program</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:16px;">Build your own clientele. On your terms.</h2>
        <p style="max-width:440px;">
          We're hand-picking a small group of Founding Barbers across Melbourne
          ahead of launch. Get in early and shape the platform.
        </p>
        <ul class="benefit-list">
          <li><span class="tick">✓</span> Priority placement and visibility at launch</li>
          <li><span class="tick">✓</span> Set your own prices, service area, and availability</li>
          <li><span class="tick">✓</span> Keep all of your earnings, no commission, ever</li>
          <li><span class="tick">✓</span> Work from your shop, home, or mobile, whatever fits your business</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="waitlist-form">
        <h3>Apply for Founding Barber access</h3>
        <p class="form-sub">Takes about a minute. We'll follow up before launch.</p>

        <form class="js-waitlist-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/xqernrla" method="POST">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New Shorter Founding Barber application" />
          <input type="hidden" name="audience" value="barber" />

          <div class="field">
            <label for="b-name">Full name</label>
            <input id="b-name" type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name" />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="b-contact">Email or mobile number</label>
            <input id="b-contact" type="text" name="contact" required autocomplete="email" />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="b-area">Suburb / service area</label>
            <input id="b-area" type="text" name="area" placeholder="e.g. Melbourne" required />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="b-setup">How do you currently work?</label>
            <select id="b-setup" name="setup">
              <option value="shop">Shop-based</option>
              <option value="home">Home-based</option>
              <option value="mobile">Mobile</option>
              <option value="mixed" selected>A mix of the above</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="b-experience">Years of experience (optional)</label>
            <input id="b-experience" type="text" name="experience" placeholder="e.g. 5" />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="b-social">Instagram or TikTok handle (optional)</label>
            <input id="b-social" type="text" name="social" placeholder="@yourhandle" />
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Apply as a Founding Barber</button>
          <p class="form-foot">By applying, you agree to be contacted about the Founding Barber program. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
          <div class="form-status" role="status"></div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="updates">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow on-light">Founder updates</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:16px;">Building Shorter, in public</h2>
        <p>Real progress, real timelines, no fluff. Here's what's happened so far.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="updates-list">
        <div class="update-item">
          <div class="update-date">Jul 2026</div>
          <div>
            <span class="update-tag">Build</span>
            <h3>Shorter is officially in motion</h3>
            <p>Development is underway with our build partner, and this is just the first step towards something much bigger. Curious why we're building it? <a href="#about">Read the story</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="update-item">
          <div class="update-date">Jul 2026</div>
          <div>
            <span class="update-tag">Barbers</span>
            <h3>Founding Barber outreach begins across Melbourne</h3>
            <p>We're reaching out to the first wave of independent and mobile barbers across Metro Melbourne, with Australia-wide, then global, outreach to follow as we grow.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="update-item">
          <div class="update-date">Jul 2026</div>
          <div>
            <span class="update-tag">Waitlist</span>
            <h3>Customer and barber waitlists are live</h3>
            <p>You're looking at it: join above to get early access and be first to hear every update as we build towards launch.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="update-item">
          <div class="update-date">Est. Dec 2026</div>
          <div>
            <span class="update-tag">Milestone</span>
            <h3>App Store &amp; Google Play submission prep begins</h3>
            <p>Store listings, screenshots, and review requirements go in ahead of a targeted early-2027 launch, pending Apple and Google review.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="about" style="background:var(--grey-050);">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow on-light">The founder</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:16px;">Why I'm building Shorter</h2>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align:left;">
        <p>There was a time when barbering was different.</p>
        <p>Demand was growing faster than the number of skilled barbers. Shops had loyal teams, customers knew where to go, and talented barbers could build successful careers.</p>
        <p>Then everything changed.</p>
        <p>Social media exploded. Barbering became one of the most popular trades in the world. Thousands of people entered the industry, more shops opened than ever before, and more barbers started working independently from home or on their own.</p>
        <p>Today, barbering is more freelance than it's ever been.</p>
        <p>Yet barbers still earn in almost the same way they always have.</p>
        <p>You either work in a shop, own a shop, or cut from home. Your income is still limited by your location, your roster, and your appointments.</p>
        <p>At the same time, customers are left with another problem.</p>
        <p>If you need a haircut today, or even tonight, there's no simple way to find an available, quality barber right now. Existing booking platforms are built for future appointments, not immediate availability.</p>
        <p>It made me ask a simple question.</p>
        <p>If drivers can go online whenever they want and earn immediately, why can't barbers?<br>
        Why can't skilled barbers make themselves available when they choose?<br>
        Why can't customers instantly see who's available nearby?<br>
        Why hasn't barbering caught up with the on-demand world?</p>
        <p>That's why I created Shorter.</p>
        <p>Shorter gives barbers the freedom to earn on their own terms while making it easier for customers to find quality barbers exactly when they need one.</p>
        <p>I'm not trying to replace great barber shops.</p>
        <p>I'm trying to create more opportunity for great barbers and more convenience for customers.</p>
        <p>I believe barbering deserves the same flexibility, accessibility, and technology that has transformed so many other industries.</p>
        <p>This is the future I wish existed when I was behind the chair.</p>
        <p>So I decided to build it.</p>
        <p style="font-weight:700; color:var(--black); margin-top:28px;">We're starting with barbers, but this is just the beginning.</p>
      </div>
      <p style="font-weight:700; color:var(--black); margin-top:24px;">- Armen, Founder of Shorter</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
